「都子…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUm, listen... you're no longer the Osamu that divorced\nMs. Kouno. You're no longer lacking in anything.\d%K%P
「现在的理君啊…\n已经不是那个和老师分手时『残缺的理君』了啊…」%K%P
Toko was crying.%K%P
都子在哭泣。%K%P
The 14th of February. A day of happiness and joy.%K%P
在２月１４号，这个美丽的日子里…%K%P
The first Thursday in a very long while when I skipped\nwork. A delayed celebration of Toko passing her exams.%K%P
久违了不用上班的周四。\n延期一个月的合格庆祝。%K%P
The Valentine's Day on which Toko's handmade chocolate\ncake struck and melted my heart like hydrochloric acid.%K%P
还有，极具都子风格的手制巧克力、\n难以忘怀的情人节%K%P
And yet... she was crying.%K%P
然而…都子在哭泣着。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIt might have started with something silly.\nPerhaps I was simply starved for the affection of my\nmother.\d%K%P
「契机，也许难以启齿。\n也许你只是想依靠妈妈而已」%K%P
I lost my love. My job. My hopes.%K%P
失去了爱人、失去了工作、失去了希望…%K%P
But just when I thought that I'd lost everything, Ms.\nHonoka appeared before my eyes... and I fell in love again\nfor the first time in a long while.%K%P
就在那时，出现在我面前的穗香小姐，\n让我的内心产生了一年没有过了的恋情。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAnd then you came into my life, forgetting your own\nmisfortune, taking pity on me without being prompted.\nBefore I knew it, we were living together.\d%K%P
「就算这样，理君你…还是出现在我面前。\n忘记了自己的不幸，擅自同情起我，\n最后还住进了公寓」%K%P
Yet it turned out I was the only one who felt that way. I\nhad my heart shattered all over again and plunged back\ninto despair.%K%P
但那是虚假的恋情，\n它再次打碎了我的心，让我陷入不知是第几次的绝望之中。%K%P
And before my eyes stood a girl possessing a heart\nentirely different from Ms. Honoka's -- rather than gently\nembracing you, Toko's brand of kindness hit you in the\nface and set you straight.%K%P
就在这时，出现在我面前的，\n是与将温柔饱含在内心的穗香小姐相对照的，\n有着直白温柔的小房东小姐。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou started talking about how you'd look after me until I\nwas old enough. How you'd protect me and so on. And you\nhardly ever asked for my consent.\d%K%P
「说要养育我，\n说要守护我，直到走入社会，\n不顾我的意见，擅自一个人忙活」%K%P
At first, I was completely outmatched by this girl so far\nbelow my age. Despite being the adult, I was the one\ncausing trouble for her.%K%P
从一开始，我就在这个比我年纪小的少女面前抬不起头来。\n我明白，这是我的感激与愧疚，身为大人的我总是在被照顾。%K%P
At times, I made her angry. At others, I got on her\nnerves. But she never abandoned me, nor did she hesitate\nto reprimand me for my faults. She consoled me when I\nneeded it the most.%K%P
我经常惹她生气，让她失望，但她从没有抛弃我，\n只是不断叱责我，鼓励我，一直等待着我。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAt first, I didn't trust you at all... I mean, nothing\nwent the way I wanted it... But in retrospect, it actually\nwasn't all that bad.\d%K%P
「我啊，一开始是完全不相信的…\n觉得你的人生果然净是失败，\n但也真是不可思议，也并非都是令人心酸的事情」%K%P
I kept feeling ashamed of myself as I showered her with\napologies. I couldn't count the number of times I was on\nthe verge of tears. Yet she always responded with a smile\nand a pat on the back, and sometimes even her own tears.%K%P
多少次的道歉，多少次的羞愧，多少次都快要哭出来了。\n每到那个时候，她就会对我微笑，拍我的背，\n让我感动得更加想哭。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWe heaved sigh after sigh, realizing that trials were\njust a part of life. But at the same time, I couldn't help\nsmiling. I felt we could overcome anything with the two of\nus.\d%K%P
「世界上也存在着这种情况呢，两人一起叹气，\n但最后都会破涕为笑…\n和理君在一起的话，我就会觉得继续努力也挺好的」%K%P
That gave me the power to stand back on my feet after each\nfailure.%K%P
所以，无论我失败多少次，都不会害怕…%K%P
I would've been lying if I said I wasn't scared, but the\ncourage she filled me with helped cure that ailment.%K%P
不，说实话，我还是害怕的，\n但现在的我能够在提心吊胆中努力，我拥有那样的勇气了。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dEventually, things started to look better. Like we could\nstart fresh from the start line again.\d%K%P
「于是，风向终于发生了变化，\n理君的人生和我的人生，\n似乎又一次站在了起跑线上」%K%P
We did our best.%K%P
两人共同努力…%K%P
We eventually turned Toko's distant dream of continuing\nher studies into a realistic goal.%K%P
让都子的梦想，\n或者说不是梦想而是目标——升学，得到实现。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWe met so many people during that time, and even when our\nlives slowly began drifting apart a little...\d%K%P
「这段时间里，各种各样的人们，与我们扯上了关系，\n理君的人生和我的人生，\n似乎也越来越远了…」%K%P
The paths of countless people crossed with ours, sometimes\nsupplying us with trials, and sometimes with bliss. They\nall served as catalysts for a whole variety of emotions,\nbut...%K%P
诸多人的人生与我们相重合，\n给予我们试练，也给予我们幸福，\n同时也带来了各种各样的感情变化。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...you'd still think of me first without fail.\nYou'd always prioritize me over everyone else.\d%K%P
「即便如此，理君你…\n总是把我放在第一位来考虑…\n无论发生什么，都以我为优先」%K%P
Amidst all those emotions, one had remained completely\nunchanged since the very beginning.%K%P
即使如此，我也可以断言，\n只有一种情感，我从来都没有含糊对待过。%K%P
One that declared Toko as the single most important girl\nin my life.%K%P
那就是，这个世界上，都子是我现在最珍重的女孩。%K%P
Or perhaps... that feeling did change a little with the\nlong passage of time.%K%P
不…随着时间的推移，\n这种情感也在微微变化着。%K%P
\dMs. Landlord is the most important girl to me in the\nworld.\d\n\dMitoko is the most important girl to me in the world.\d\n\dToko is the most important girl to me in the world.\d%K%P
『因为这个世界上，房东小姐是我现在最珍重的女孩』\n『因为这个世界上，美都子是我现在最珍重的女孩』\n『因为这个世界上，都子是我现在最珍重的女孩』%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUm, listen... you're no longer the Osamu that divorced\nMs. Kouno. You're no longer lacking in anything.\d%K%P
「呐，理君…\n现在的理君，已经不是和老师分手时\n那个『残缺的理君』了啊…」%K%P
Asami once promised to teach me all about it.%K%P
过去…\n麻实说要向我呈现的。%K%P
The happiness of being a family, having children, and\nworking for someone else's sake -- a future filled with\njoy.%K%P
呈现构筑家庭，爱着自己的孩子，为了家庭而工作的幸福…\n呈现被那样的快乐包裹起的未来…%K%P
But Asami failed.%K%P
然而麻实受挫了。%K%P
There was nothing she could do about it, and instead kept\nthe cause hidden and took on the role of a villain,\neventually fading out of my life.%K%P
虽然那时我们遭遇了无可奈何的事情…\n但麻实一味地瞒着我，只把自己当成恶人，\n渐渐淡出了我的视线。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou raised me to the best of your ability, and loved\nme... as a daughter. You're already pretty much a full-\nfledged parent at this point, although maybe a tad\noverprotective.\d%K%P
「拼命努力来养育我…\n一直把我当作“女儿”来爱…\n…不，你成了一个普通的，为女儿操心的父亲了哦？」%K%P
But after a year, my life saw the arrival of...%K%P
那之后过了一年…%K%P
...a tiny little angel who, despite her small frame, was\nmature beyond her years.%K%P
一个很小很小，但却有些成熟、可靠的天使\n出现在我面前。%K%P
She made her way straight to the core of my heart and\ntaught me all the things Asami had wanted.%K%P
她渗入了我的内心，\n一个个按顺序、小心地、饱含深情地向我呈现了。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThere's no longer anything separating you two. The very\nreason you parted ways has vanished. It's gone.\d%K%P
「所以…\n理君和老师之间，已经没有什么障碍了…\n两人分开的理由，已经完全消失了」%K%P
The joys and hardships of raising another person, the\nboundless affection filling your heart as you see their\nlife grow...%K%P
呈现了养育一个人的辛苦和纠葛，以及…\n开心和快乐…满溢而出的爱。%K%P
The Osamu that Asami wanted. A father who worked for his\nfamily and loved his children.%K%P
让我像麻实所期望的那样，成为了一个父亲。\n构筑家庭，爱着自己的孩子，为了家庭而工作。%K%P
Toko was the one who taught me all about that bliss.%K%P
呈现了被开心和快乐所包围的现在…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI mean, isn't it... isn't it obvious at this point?\d%K%P
「因为、因为…\n那种事，是理所当然的，对吧？」%K%P
Toko made me understand it all; using her honest, child-\nlike love, she tried desperately to fix me.%K%P
都子向我呈现了。\n用孩子的爱，拼命矫正了我。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI could... turn the entire world upside down and I still\nwouldn't be able to find a better dad than you!!\d%K%P
「这么好的爸爸…\n在世界上打着灯笼也找不到啊！」%K%P
But it cost her gravely -- she found herself tormented by\nthe hardships of adult love.%K%P
自身的矛盾和纠葛…\n在我意识到的时候，已经被“女孩的心意”所替换了。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAhah... ahaha... uah, hah... khh... uah...\d%K%P
「啊哈、啊哈哈…呜、呜…呜…呜、呜…」%K%P
