%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
Toko was crying before my eyes.%K%P
都子在哭泣。%K%P
Her shoulders trembled with each new sob, yet Toko did her\nbest to keep her heart strong and resolute -- like a true\nadult would.%K%P
在我的面前。\n小小的肩膀颤抖着。\n只有内心还在拼命逞强。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dFweeeh... uahh, agh... aaaaah...!\d%K%P
「呜呜呜呜…呜、呜…啊啊啊啊…」%K%P
Toko... was crying.%K%P
都子…在哭泣着。%K%P
She didn't condemn me for taking over a month to answer\nher confession.%K%P
她并没有责备对她的告白置之不理长达一个月的我。%K%P
The shock of learning the truth about Asami made me avert\nmy eyes from Toko's efforts, but she hurled no words of\ncondemnation at me.%K%P
并没有责备受到麻实『隐瞒的真相』打击、\n一直无视着都子努力的我。%K%P
Because she knew I'd keep on going in circles, unable to\nmake a decision.%K%P
因为她知道，我为了作出决断，\n烦恼、痛苦…辗转反侧。%K%P
Toko tried to give me a way out. A means to escape from\nthe pain I very much deserved.%K%P
都子她…\n甚至想要像这样，\n把我从那不过是我自作自受的痛苦中拯救出来…%K%P
All by herself.%K%P
她自己下了决断。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'll go home by myself, okay?\d%K%P
「我一个人回去了啊」%K%P
Toko turned her back to me.%K%P
都子转身背向了我。%K%P
The sound of her feet crunching through the fresh snow\nreverberated across the nearly deserted station square.%K%P
踏雪的『沙沙』声在行人很少的车站前，显得格外清晰。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dStarting tomorrow, I'll go back to how I used to be a\nyear ago. A girl who's really attached to her father and\nis somewhat jealous of her mother, but still loves both\nher parents from the bottom of her heart.\d%K%P
「从明天开始，我会变回去年那个我的。\n虽然会有些父控，偶尔会吃妈妈的醋，\n但我一定会成为最喜欢你们两人的，爱撒娇的女儿…」%K%P
Her words were barely audible, but due to the silence\nenveloping the station, I managed to make them out.%K%P
她那有气无力的声音…\n在这寂静的环境里，清晰地传入我的耳中。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dSo, Osamu... I expect you to stay your usual self. Don't\nstart... hating or avoiding me, okay?\d%K%P
「所以，理君也继续做原来的理君就好。\n不要…讨厌我好吗？\n不要躲着我好吗？%K%P
Toko's shoes sank into the snow, constantly throwing her\noff balance and slowing her steps.%K%P
都子的鞋子，\n一直到脚后跟都埋入雪中，\n放缓了离去的步伐%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dToko.\d%K%P
「都子」%K%P
Yet she still pressed forward, refusing to halt even for a\nmoment.%K%P
但她依然是一步步向前走，\n绝对不停下脚步，\n依然在做着强烈的心理斗争。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dToko, wait.\d%K%P
「都子，等等」%K%P
If anything, it seemed like she actually quickened her\npace each time I called out to her.%K%P
不仅如此，每当我呼喊一声，\n她就像是难以忍受似的，\n加快了步伐…%K%P
%LCOsamu
