With her shoulders still trembling, Toko darted off.%K%P
肩膀微微一颤…\n她完全从我身边逃开了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dListen, Toko!\nI... I...!\d%K%P
「听我说啊，都子！\n我、我…」%K%P
As such, it was finally time for -me- to make a decision.%K%P
所以我…\n这次，一定要做决断。%K%P
Or rather, express my feelings -- in other words, what I'd\nalready decided -- in a way she would understand.%K%P
不…这是已经下定决心了的情感。\n我只是要将其传达出去而已。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI... love you, Toko!!\nI love you! I love you! I love you more than anyone\nelse!!!\d%K%P
「我………喜欢都子～！\n喜欢喜欢最喜欢了～！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhoaaaaah?!\d%K%P
