「啊啊！？\n没、没事吧，都子！」%K%P
Toko... fell.%K%P
都子…摔倒了。%K%P
About thirty or so steps away from me, she slipped on ice,\nand fell face-first into a pile of snow.%K%P
就在离开我大概三十步远的地方，\n她一下子滑倒，脸扑进雪里。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAh... ah... ahh... ahh...!\d%K%P
「啊…啊…啊………啊啊…！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
