Yet she wouldn't rise to her feet -- she froze up and\nlooked at me with bewildered eyes, staying on all fours in\nthe snow.%K%P
然而都子并没有完全站起来。\n膝盖和双臂贴在雪地上，\n就这样呆呆不动了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dToko... I...\d%K%P
「都子…真的…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
