「那是，那个…\n都、都子你才是，一个月前，对我，那个…」%K%P
The fact that I still let embarrassment get the better of\nme here was proof enough of my inexperience with this sort\nof thing.%K%P
在这种地方竟然羞涩了，\n所以我永远也无法成为一流吧。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI... I can still say it without serious repercussions! I\nmean, you could chalk it up to being a girl's first crush\nor a silly misunderstanding! There are countless excuses I\ncan use!\d%K%P
「我、我那么说倒也没什么！\n初恋啊，青春期啊，被温柔对待就会误会啊，\n事后怎么说都能解释得通！」%K%P
