%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIs it wrong for me to say this?\nIs it wrong for me to confess that I love you?\d%K%P
「由我来说…不行吗？\n我喜欢都子…向你告白，不行吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
