%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI've been a full-fledged member of society for the past\nseven years, and I've already seen my life fall apart more\nthan once. ...I know what it means to be responsible for\none's words and actions.\d%K%P
「我进入社会７年了。\n经常有身败名裂的时候呢。\n…我会对自己的话好好负责的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou can't do this! I mean, you just got your life back on\ntrack! You could start fresh and live happily ever after\nwith Ms. Kouno!\d%K%P
「那是不行的啊！\n明明好不容易时来运转的！明明能重新开始了的！\n明明和老师又一次的幸福人生就在前方了的！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI, um... would rather find happiness by your side. Is\nthat wrong?\d%K%P
「我，那个…\n想要和都子幸福起来…不行吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAh! Ah! Aaaaaaah! I can't hear you! I can't hear you! I\ncan't listen to this! I can't feel happy about this!!\d%K%P
「啊～！啊～！啊啊啊啊啊～！\n听不到听不到，不能听！\n开心什么的，可不能随便弄错啊～！」%K%P
Toko covered her ears with her snow-covered hands.%K%P
都子用沾满雪的手捂住了双耳。%K%P
Panicked, confused, and still shouting her lungs out, Toko\nclosed her eyes and gritted her teeth.%K%P
慌张不已、混乱至极，大声怒吼，\n不停摇头，眼睛紧紧闭着，紧咬着牙齿。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI love you.\nYou're the only one for me, Toko.\d%K%P
「我喜欢你…\n只喜欢你一个」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI just said I can't hear you! How can you even say\nsomething that embarrassing when you're thirty?!\d%K%P
「不是说听不到了吗！\n都３０岁的人了，不要说这种不知羞耻的话啊！」%K%P
Yet her fingers made just enough cracks for even my\nsoftest whispers to reach her, to which she never failed\nto overreact.%K%P
即使如此，她一定还是倾听着我的每一句低语，\n一句话也没漏听，产生了过剩的反应。%K%P
