%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut you're the one I love.\nIt has to be you.\d%K%P
「即便如此，我还是喜欢都子！\n不是都子就不行！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhy?! I'm still a student!\nI don't know a thing about love!\d%K%P
「为什么啊！？\n我还是个学生哦？\n是个连真正恋爱是什么都不知道的小屁孩哦！？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIn that case, I'll teach you everything you need to\nknow!\d%K%P
「如果你不知道的话，我什么都会教给你的！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhat a perverted creep! Is that how much you want my\nbody?!\d%K%P
「你这变态！就是这么渴求我的身体吗！？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...You can say whatever you want, but it won't change\nthat I love you!\d%K%P
「………随你怎么说，我只要有都子你就好了！」%K%P
That one... did kinda hurt.\nStill, I couldn't back down now.%K%P
刚才她的话语，有点…不，很是戳到了我的痛处，\n即便如此，我也不会就此退缩。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou're acting strange, Osamu! You're being weird!!\nThis isn't something I'd expect an adult to say!\d%K%P
「很奇怪，很奇怪啊，理君！\n这可不是大人说的话啊！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHow many times do I have to tell you that I haven't grown\nup at all?! That I'm still as helpless as I was before?!\d%K%P
「所以我不是说过了吗！\n我完全没有成长！\n现在依然是那个废柴！」%K%P
I did expect her to try and deny this.%K%P
…我就猜会遭到她的否定。%K%P
Toko herself didn't mind falling, but was terrified by the\nidea of dragging me down with her.%K%P
因为都子虽然对自己的堕落并不反感，\n但对于我的堕落，一定非常踌躇吧。%K%P
Once her ever-escalating feelings detonated, she would\nperhaps regret it deeply -- but in the end, Toko would\nstill rein in her emotions so as not to cause others\ntrouble.%K%P
她大概只是想着，自己的情绪高涨了，盛大地爆发一次，\n然后考虑到了周围的事，顿时就后悔了，\n最后哭着来收拾残局吧。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI can't do anything without you by my side!\nYour courage, your care... without them, I...!\d%K%P
「我不能在都子身边就不行！\n勤劳的都子、喜欢照顾人的都子…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dO...samu...\d%K%P
「理…理…君…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI can't think of a more energetic and positive girl. I'm\nhopeless without you to support me!\d%K%P
「最重要的是，精神、开朗…\n直率地表达自己心意的都子，不是这样的都子就不行啊！」%K%P
If Toko froze her heart to conveniently act like a good\ngirl for my sake alone, I would eventually fall apart.%K%P
冰冻自己的内心、扮演好孩子的都子，\n迟早会让我心碎的。%K%P
I wanted us to be on the same page, always connected.%K%P
我想要永远用真心话、用真实的内心，\n和她紧密相连。%K%P
That's why... I wanted to know about her true feelings.\nAnd I wanted to answer them with my own.%K%P
所以我…\n想知道都子的真心实意。\n然后，将这思念与我的心意相合。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUh... khh... uah...!\d%K%P
「呜…呜…呜呜呜～…」%K%P
Toko's teeth began clattering.%K%P
都子的牙齿嘚嘚地响着。%K%P
Not because of the cold, though. After all, her face had\nflushed a hue of deep crimson -- I could almost feel its\nheat from here.%K%P
但这并不是因为寒冷。\n因为…她的脸，通红通红的。%K%P
That face told me...%K%P
她的表情向我诉说着。%K%P
...that she didn't know what to do. That she couldn't\nunderstand why I was saying all this now. ...That I was a\ncoward, and late... and a fool.%K%P
“不知道该怎么办才好”。\n“为什么事到如今才说这种话”。\n…“卑鄙”，“太迟了”，“笨蛋”。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUah... uh... fweh... eh, ehh...\d%K%P
「呜…呜…呜呜…呜、呜呜…」%K%P
However, no matter how her expression changed...%K%P
不过，无论她的表情怎样变化…%K%P
...there was not a sliver of hate in her gaze.\nShe looked at me with the same eyes I was looking at her.%K%P
她都没有显出对我的厌恶。\n她一直用与我相同的目光，注视着我。%K%P
My words shook her heart to its core.%K%P
我的话语让她的内心动摇着。%K%P
