%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
Toko slowly stood up.%K%P
都子慢慢站了起来。%K%P
Her knees still trembled ever so lightly, and she had her\nteeth clenched as tears trailed down her cheeks.%K%P
虽然膝盖还在微微颤抖，\n牙齿也还紧咬着，\n…泪水也依然是哗哗直掉。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNo... we can't do this.\d%K%P
「果然…还是不行」%K%P
Yet the words she forced out of her throat were still\nseeped in self-constraint.%K%P
即使如此，从她的喉头挤出的话语，\n依然带着拼命忍耐的情感。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI... can't do something that cruel.\nI can't ruin both you and Ms. Kouno over my feelings.\d%K%P
「我…无法做出那么残酷的事。\n为了实现自己的思念，\n把理君和老师都卷进来，那样太任性了」%K%P
Despite having long since strayed from the right path, she\nstill tried to talk like an honor student.%K%P
她早就已经失去优等生的立场了，\n但所作出的发言依然带有优等生的风格。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI told you I'll go home on my own, and that's final.\nDon't follow me, Osamu.\d%K%P
「我说一个人回去，就会一个人回去的…\n别跟过来啊…理君」%K%P
