Toko turned her back to me once again.%K%P
都子再次背对我。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI know you'll come back here.\nBack to my side.\d%K%P
「你一定会回来的。\n一定会回到我身边的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI would... never...\d%K%P
「那是…不可能的」%K%P
She took the first step towards her path home.%K%P
然后，她踏上了归途。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'll be waiting here until you do.\nAt least until this day ends.\d%K%P
