%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou're gonna catch a cold.\nYou can't do that.\d%K%P
「会感冒的…\n那可不行啊」%K%P
With the piled-up snow still constantly throwing her off-\nbalance, Toko's steps were getting wider and wider.%K%P
她走路的时候，雪依然是埋到了鞋上的脚踝处，\n但她还是迈出了大步子，向前走去。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm not going to catch anything.\nI know you'll turn around in no time.\d%K%P
