%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dSee you later, then...\d%K%P
「那就这样，再见了…」%K%P
Toko, seemingly no longer hearing my voice, continued down\nthe snow-covered road.%K%P
都子仿佛是为了不再听到我的声音似的，\n一步步地在雪中迈着坚实的步伐。%K%P
She wouldn't turn around to look at me.\nShe wouldn't stop, not even for a moment.%K%P
没有回头。没有止步。%K%P
Passing the thirty step mark where she last fell, Toko\ncontinued to walk further and further away from me.%K%P
离刚才摔倒的地方已经有三十步远了，\n她更进一步拉开了与我的距离。%K%P
The sound of crunching snow grew fainter and fainter,\nuntil I could no longer make it out anymore.%K%P
都子踏雪的脚步声逐渐远去，\n很快就从我耳边消失了。%K%P
Still... I kept my eyes focused on her back.%K%P
即使如此，我…\n并没有把目光从她的背后移开。%K%P
