距离我…大概有近百步了。%K%P
...Toko's steps began slowing down.%K%P
都子的脚步越来越沉重…%K%P
Before long, she came to a dead stop in the middle of the\nroad.%K%P
然后在道路中央，完全停了下来。%K%P
