%LC美都子
\dHuh...?\d%K%P
「咦…？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI wonder if I got tired.\d%K%P
「是累了吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWh-What's going on? What's wrong with my legs...?\d%K%P
