%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThey aren't moving...?\nI can't take a single step like this...\d%K%P
「动不了了…？\n呐，向前一步也走不动了…？」%K%P
Clearly in a state of confusion, Toko seemed to be having\na conversation with her legs.%K%P
都子明显露出了困惑的样子，\n叱责着自己的脚。%K%P
She hit her thighs a few times, pressed her palms against\nher knees, and tried stretching them a few times.%K%P
又是敲击大腿，又是拍打膝盖，又是伸展弯曲。%K%P
Yet still she failed to move even an inch from where she\nhad stopped.\nIt was as though an invisible wall was blocking her way.%K%P
但她依然无法继续前进。\n仿佛有什么在拒绝她前进似的，让她动弹不得。%K%P
