今天是都子的纪念日…%K%P
If things had been just a little different, the Terrace\nHouse Hinosaka gang would have been dominating these\nseats.%K%P
我在想，本来的话，监护人席位上的一列，\n会不会被Terrace House阳之坂的众位所占据呢…%K%P
