「毕业证书，授予」%K%P
Since that fateful Valentine's Day...%K%P
在那天之后…%K%P
When I finally gave voice to my forbidden feelings, and\nhad Toko accept them with all her heart and soul...%K%P
在我把禁断的思绪传达给都子，\n都子也全心全力接受了的那个情人节之后。%K%P
...the Terrace House Hinosaka, as well as its neighborhood\naround East Hagimori's 3rd District...%K%P
Terrace House阳之坂…\n包括邻居在内的东荻守三丁目周围…%K%P
...fell into complete silence.%K%P
不出意料地变得宁静万分。%K%P
Mr. Retired resignedly shook his head.\nMr. Kumazaki gave me an accusing look.\nYasunaga stopped looking me in the eyes.%K%P
老爷子好像放弃一般，摇着头；\n熊崎先生用责备的目光看我；\n八须永君则是连看都不看我一眼了。%K%P
Ms. Kaya seemed to have predicted this outcome to a\ncertain extent, but she still stopped treating me the way\nshe used to.%K%P
夏夜小姐似乎有了一定程度的预感，\n但她也没有一如既往地和我相处了。%K%P
I kept seeing Himeo at work, but resuming her studies in\nApril left her with little time for any conversation.%K%P
和姬绪小姐倒是在公司见过几次面，\n但从四月开始她就一心准备复学，\n几乎没有和我说过话。%K%P
But I was okay with it.\nI was prepared for it all.%K%P
但即便如此，我也觉得这样就好。\n因为我已经做好觉悟了。%K%P
I chose Toko's warmth over the warmth of everyone else.%K%P
因为我选择了将一直以来我所得到的全部温暖\n替换为都子一个人的温暖了。%K%P
I chose to protect my bond with her, even if it led to the\ncollapse of every other relationship I had built up over\nthe year.%K%P
因为我选择了即使所有的社交网络都崩坏，\n也要去守护和都子之间深深的羁绊之路。%K%P
Yes, I was prepared for it.%K%P
没错，我不在意。%K%P
But Toko...%K%P
可是都子她…%K%P
She ended up banished from our community alongside myself.\nA bright and earnest girl who never did anything wrong.%K%P
这个和我一起被当作异类的、\n开朗、活泼、努力…没有罪过的少女…%K%P
.........%K%P
………%K%P
......%K%P
……%K%P
...%K%P
…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dNext, Class 3-D. Akagi Yoshito.\d%K%P
「接下来，３年Ｄ班。\n…赤城义人」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
Pulled back to reality by a familiar voice, I directed my\ngaze towards the stage and saw -her-.%K%P
听到了熟悉的声音，我的思绪被拉回到了当前的舞台，\n在那里的，果然是我所熟悉的身影。%K%P
A woman I met ten years ago. We gave each other love,\npain, and tears in equal measure...%K%P
十年前的相遇、相爱、相求、伤害、破坏…%K%P
...and ended up reunited just last year. I sought her\ncompany again, eventually learning of a deep wound she had\nkept hidden from me. Yet in the end, all I did was thrust\na knife into it.%K%P
然后在去年，我和她重逢了，再次渴求着她，\n知晓了多年没有发现的深深伤痕…\n然而，我将那伤口扩得更大。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIt's snowing...\d%K%P
「雪…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...It sure is.\d%K%P
「…真的啊」%K%P
White, crystalline snowflakes filled the grey skies above\nas we left the hotel's cafe.%K%P
从酒店的咖啡馆里出来，\n在太阳已经西沉的灰暗天空中，\n纯白的结晶一粒粒地开始飘落下来。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWell, I got what I came for, but... I guess we can't just\ncall it a day here.\d%K%P
「好了，我的目的已经达成了…\n就此解散什么的…你还不能吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...I'm sorry.\d%K%P
「…抱歉」%K%P
I prodded at the paper wrapping of the chocolate tucked in\nmy pocket.%K%P
我的指尖触碰到了装在口袋里的巧克力纸包。%K%P
Asami curtly handed it to me in the hotel lobby without\nany theatrics.%K%P
这是刚才麻实在酒店前厅买的，\n她买了后当场就说『这个给你』，然后就毫无情趣地递给了我。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWell then... let's take a walk, I suppose.\d%K%P
「那么，稍微…走一会儿吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYeah...\d%K%P
「嗯…」%K%P
The 14th of February, 6PM. Thursday.%K%P
２月１４日，周四。\n下午６点。%K%P
Valentine's Day -- a holiday for every confectionery\ncompany in the nation.%K%P
糕点公司针对世间单方面缔结的纪念日。\n名曰『情人节』。%K%P
...An hour before my meeting with Toko.%K%P
…与都子约好的碰面，还剩１个小时。%K%P
I had yet to confess my true feelings to Asami.%K%P
其实我还没有把自己真正的心意告诉麻实。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh... This is gonna pile up by tomorrow.\d%K%P
「啊～啊…说不定能堆积起来呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Yeah.\d%K%P
「…是啊」%K%P
The hill at the nearby park gave us a perfect view of the\ncityscape getting gradually enveloped by snow.%K%P
从地势高的公园放眼望去，\n只见整个街道很快就覆盖上了白茫茫的一层。%K%P
There was no one here besides us at this cold and dark\nhour. The entire area was silent enough for us to hear our\nown footsteps and even breathing.%K%P
在这冰冷、昏暗的公园里，\n几乎已经没什么行人了，\n只听得到我们的低语声、脚步声和呼吸声。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dUm, Osamu...\d%K%P
「呐，理…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYes?\d%K%P
「什么？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dDo you want me to guess what you're going to say?\d%K%P
「你准备说的话，\n能让我猜猜看吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSorry, but let me do the talking this time. Although, as\na guy who was unable to even broach the topic for over an\nhour, I guess I've no right to say that.\d%K%P
「抱歉，还是让我来说吧。\n那个…虽然这不是一个小时里什么都没说的男人该说的话」%K%P
It had been an hour since we met up at the cafe.%K%P
在我和麻实进入咖啡馆的一个小时前。%K%P
I was the one who invited her, mentioning how I had\nsomething important to talk about, yet here I was again...%K%P
我主动对她说『有很重要的事』，\n特意把下班的她叫了出来，但却发展成了这般狼狈样。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI have a pretty good idea of what it could be, based on\nthe fact you keep delaying it.\d%K%P
「都到了你无法说出口的地步了，\n我是能猜到你想说什么的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI... truly am sorry.\nBut leaving even this to you would be terrible of me.\d%K%P
「真的很抱歉…\n但如果连这种事都交给麻实你，我就太差劲了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI see.\d%K%P
「是么…」%K%P
Not like I hadn't hit rock bottom already.%K%P
其实我早就已经突破了差劲的边缘，向更深处坠落着。%K%P
The words I had prepared for her were nothing short of a\nhumiliating betrayal.%K%P
我即将要说的话语，\n将会给麻实带来多大的难题、屈辱，对她是何种程度的背叛呢？%K%P
I wondered if she'd grow angry, be taken aback, or burst\nout in tears...\nI wondered which of those she'd be able to suppress...%K%P
麻实会生气吗，会吃惊吗，会哭泣吗？\n…到时候我能忍受到何种地步呢？%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAsami, I have something to tell you.\d%K%P
「麻实…请你听我说」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dGo ahead. Whenever you're ready.\d%K%P
「随时都可以，请说吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut...\d%K%P
「可是…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIt's okay. I can hear you from here.\d%K%P
「没事的，就这样说吧」%K%P
She leaned against the handrails, her gaze fixed on the\nsnow-laden city.%K%P
她扶着栏杆，紧紧注视着飞雪弥漫的街道。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dVery well...\d%K%P
「知道了…」%K%P
Refusing to look me in the eyes, she instead admonished me\nwith a voice low and gentle.%K%P
她没有与我的视线相合，\n用温柔的声音与我对着话。%K%P
Asami probably understood that if we had this conversation\nwhile looking each other in the eye, I would not have the\ncourage to finish the sentence.%K%P
如果视线相合的话，\n我会在说话的中途消沉起来，\n麻实一定是『明白』这一点，特意关照我的。%K%P
I once again found myself indulging in her kindness.%K%P
我被她这种一如既往的温柔所包围…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm... in love with Toko.\d%K%P
「我…喜欢都子」%K%P
And now my betrayal had been laid bare.%K%P
然而我辜负了她的全部温柔，\n作出了最差劲的坦白。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dShe's the most important girl to me in the entire world.\d%K%P
「对现在的我来说，都子是世界上最重要的人」%K%P
An adult man -- her guardian -- had confessed feelings\nthat modern society would never acknowledge.%K%P
对我这个一直以都子的监护人自称的男人，\n对年龄上已经完全被归为大人的人来说，\n这是一般不会得到认可的坦白。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI never would've gotten back on my feet without her. And\nwithout me, she couldn't have stayed at the Terrace House\nHinosaka, either.\d%K%P
「如果没有都子的话，我是不可能恢复到现在这个地步的。\n而且都子也是，如果没有我的话，\n她就不能继续待在Terrace House阳之坂，进而感到自负」%K%P
I, a man who mistook Asami's actions as her abandoning me,\na man who failed to even see the pain of the women closest\nto him... had confessed feelings that were deemed\nunforgivable.%K%P
对我这个误以为被麻实舍弃的男人，\n对没有看出麻实那些天的苦恼的人来说，\n这是在人道上不可原谅的坦白。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSo... from now on, I'm planning to share a path with her,\nuntil she herself decides that she no longer needs me.\d%K%P
「所以，从今以后…\n我想要和都子在一起，\n直到她说不需要我的那天为止」%K%P
I kept weaving one cruel word after another, hurling them\nat Asami's back like spears meant to kill.%K%P
这种残酷的话语…\n仿佛锥子一般，刺向了麻实的后背。%K%P
Yet she remained completely still.%K%P
麻实的身体上并没有作出反应。%K%P
Her shoulders didn't tremble in anger, nor did she writhe\nin sorrow or strike the railing with her fist.%K%P
肩膀并没有生气地颤抖，\n没有扭动身体，\n也没有握拳敲击。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIs this yet another parent-teacher conference?\nOr are you simply letting your ex know that you've found\nsomeone else?\d%K%P
「这是监护人座谈会？\n还是对与其分手了的女人所作的再起报告？」%K%P
Quite the contrary: she replied in a sarcastic tone,\nseemingly trying to make light of the situation.%K%P
她非但没有如此，\n反而是带着一点恶趣味的口吻，\n作出了挑逗般的还击。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIf it's the former, I can't approve of this. Problems\nlike that are outside the jurisdiction of a homeroom\nteacher. ...Ahaha. Graduation is right around the corner\nand you still keep bringing me more trouble.\d%K%P
「如果是前者，我是不会认可的。\n那种事可别找班主任商谈…啊哈哈。\n都已经快毕业了，还把那种麻烦事招来…」%K%P
Her shoulders finally began to tremble, but not in the way\nI had expected -- she appeared to be suppressing laughter.%K%P
她终于颤抖了的肩部\n也并没有如我想象的那样，显得痛苦不堪，\n而是感觉像是听到了什么奇怪的事而拼命忍住笑一般。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIf it's the latter, I guess I have mixed feelings about\nit. I truly am happy that you found someone to share your\nnew life with. Your choice of partner, on the other\nhand...\d%K%P
「如果是后者…既有可喜的，也有不可喜的吧。\n理和新的人开始步入新的人生，我从心底里感到开心。\n不过啊…对象嘛，稍微有点那个了」%K%P
She looked up at the sky, her white breath escaping\nthrough a wry smile. I knew it. She was still trying to be\nconsiderate with me.%K%P
她突然抬头仰望天空，苦笑着呼出了白色的叹息。\n这叹息里依然是充满了对我的怜恤。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dRight now, you're neither a homeroom teacher nor my ex-\nwife. You are your own woman -- Kouno Asami.\d%K%P
「这既不是对班主任，也不是对前妻…\n而是对香野麻实这位女性的话语，我希望你这么去想」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIs that so...\d%K%P
「是么…」%K%P
Even now, I questioned why I left this woman. And that\nfact made me feel terrible about myself.%K%P
都到今天这一步了…\n“我为什么要和这个女性分手呢”\n这另一种意义上最差劲的感情却快要涌上我的心头了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI've hurt you deeply... not once, but twice. I'm more\nthan aware of that.\d%K%P
「我真是差劲透了，两度伤害了你。\n…不过这也仅限于我自己的认知范围就是了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI can't say I remember it all that well...\d%K%P
「有那种事吗…？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThe first time was when I remained blind to your pain and\nsigned those divorce papers without even trying to talk it\nout.\d%K%P
「第一次，是我没有察觉到麻实的烦恼，没有和你充分交流，\n单方面听从了你的说辞，在离婚书上签了字」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThat's... seriously, I thought I cleared that up the\nother day. You seemed to have understood.\d%K%P
「所以说那是…\n我还以为你上次已经释怀了的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI didn't...\d%K%P
「没有的事…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dGeez, there's just no helping you.\d%K%P
「你啊…也真是的」%K%P
How could I understand? I was the one at fault, yet -she-\nkept apologizing.%K%P
明明是我惹出来的事，却反而收到了她的道歉，\n我怎么可能释怀啊。%K%P
She tried to make it seem like we were both responsible as\na single married unit, but that didn't fit with our\ncurrent situation.%K%P
因为那样的话，就如同『夫妻双方同受惩罚』一样，\n完全不是与我们的当前状况相符的态度了。%K%P
We were no longer husband and wife.\nWe no longer had any responsibility to look out for each\nother.%K%P
我们已经不是夫妻了。\n不是互相袒护、互相报以微笑的那种关系了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'll carry this with me for the rest of my life.\nI expect it to be a sin that will follow me to the grave.\d%K%P
「我会把那件事当作十字架，一生背负着的。\n因为我觉得那是一直要带进坟墓的罪孽」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou're gonna go bald if you keep worrying about every\nlittle thing. Well, I guess it'd be a bit hard to spot\nwith your height, though.\d%K%P
「总是为那种事苦恼的话…是会秃顶的哦？\n嘛，你这么高的个子，倒也很难暴露就是了」%K%P
Asami was trying to crack a joke to make me feel better.%K%P
麻实顾虑着我，想要把那事彻底当玩笑话。%K%P
Her kindness seeped into each one of her actions, and\ncontrary to their intent, only stimulated my guilt.%K%P
即使都到了这种时候，这个女性也在不经意间流露出了温柔，\n结果我的罪恶感越来越强烈了。%K%P
But... I could not take the easy way out. Not today.%K%P
但是只有今天…\n我是不能回头的。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThe second one... is that I ended up running to you for\nsupport, even though we had already separated. I'm not\nsure if I... made you confused, but I used your kindness\nin the worst way imaginable.\d%K%P
「第二次，是明明都分手了，但我又再次依靠了你，很多次地…\n…虽然我不知道那是不是让你困扰了，\n但那的确是最差劲的利用方式」%K%P
I would embrace her to soothe my heart with her scent.%K%P
我抱了她，被她那头发的香气和肌肤的触感治愈了。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI was glad to be of help, dear. ...Well, it doesn't look\nlike I managed to achieve my original goal, though.\d%K%P
「能帮上你的忙比什么都好，老公。\n…嘛，虽说本来的目的并没达成就是了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAsami...\d%K%P
「麻实…」%K%P
Unable to contain my feelings for Toko, I kept betraying\nher again and again.%K%P
即便如此，我也没有抑制住对都子的感情，\n一次又一次地背叛了她。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI figured that if you couldn't contain your illicit urges\ntowards one of my students, I might as well take her\nplace... but it seems to have only strengthened your\nresolve.\d%K%P
「对我重要的学生出手，\n我还在想自己能不能忍受得了…\n不过没想到那个学生会如此认真呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNo... I chose her.\nI chose her despite everything I did to you.\d%K%P
「不是的…\n是我选择了都子。\n对麻实你做了过分的事，最后还是选择了都子」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dMust be hard, being a man.\nYou have to shoulder the sins of girls.\d%K%P
「男人…真是辛苦啊。\n不得不去背负女人的罪孽啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSo, Asami... if you can't forgive me, then I want you to\nsay it.\d%K%P
「所以麻实…\n如果你不原谅我的话，我希望你如实说出」%K%P
And now I would commit yet another sin against Asami, who\nwas still trying to be considerate.%K%P
一心考虑着我的麻实\n进一步加深了我的罪孽。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI won't embrace Toko until I have your permission.\d%K%P
「在得到麻实的原谅之前，\n我是不会抱都子的」%K%P
Despite claiming that I'd come to the decision by myself,\nI still forced Asami to make that final push like the\ncoward I was.%K%P
都已经作出如此的『决断』了，\n我还是将最后的“求援球”交给了麻实。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNot as Ms. Kouno, and not as Yoshimura, but as a woman I\nused to love. Tell me how you feel... as Kouno Asami.\d%K%P
「不是香野老师，不是芳村小姐…\n我希望听到的是我爱过的人…\n香野麻实的真心话」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
There were no people in the park.%K%P
公园里已经没有人了。%K%P
Snow was gradually piling up on Asami's back and head.\nAnd probably mine as well.%K%P
麻实的后背和头发上\n也都微微地积了雪花。\n当然了，我也是同样的情况吧。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dOsamu, you see, I...\d%K%P
「理，我啊…」%K%P
Before I knew it, the blizzard seemed to have grown worse.%K%P
雪不知不觉下得更大了。%K%P
We could no longer see a city gently covered in white --\nthe falling snow had begun to obstruct our field of\nvision.%K%P
视野里的街道染上了一片洁白，已经看不见了。\n眼前的雪甚至都遮挡住了这一幕景象。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dTo tell the truth... I'm not that worried about you two.\d%K%P
「其实啊…\n也不是太担心你们两个」%K%P
As a result, I was no longer able to spot the slight\nchanges in her mannerisms or tone of voice.%K%P
所以…\n麻实细微的动作、略微有些变化了的声音，我已经察觉不出了。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dNow that she's put her feelings into words, she'll never\nwaver again. I imagine she'll be just as good a lover as\nanyone else. You'll find your salvation at her side.\d%K%P
「那孩子不仅能传达自己的情感，而且内心毫不动摇。\n她肯定会继续做一个好孩子，成为一个好的恋人，\n将理拯救，这些我是明白的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI... think so, too.\d%K%P
