To do what Asami couldn't...\nTeaching me about what family meant.%K%P
另一个目标…\n那是她说要向我呈现的事。%K%P
The happiness of being a family, having children, and\nworking for someone else's sake -- a future filled with\njoy.%K%P
呈现构筑家庭，爱着自己的孩子，为了家庭而工作的幸福…\n呈现被那样的快乐包裹住的未来…%K%P
