因为…都子在等着我。%K%P
The woman I needed to confess my feelings to had likely\nalready arrived at the place we agreed upon.%K%P
因为我的心意所应该传达的女性，\n也许已经到达约定的地方了。%K%P
I glanced back at Asami one last time...%K%P
然后我…\n在最后，再次转身看向麻实…%K%P
