都子回到了我身边。%K%P
...with reddened eyes and a painfully forced smile.%K%P
眼睛通红，好像是哭肿的。\n脸上浮现出让人心疼的笑容。%K%P
Yet she still had it in her to look me straight in the eye\nand announce her graduation with pride and confidence.%K%P
即使如此，她还是直直地向上看着我，\n堂堂正正地作出了自豪的毕业宣言。%K%P
