I casually gave her my hand, letting everyone know that\nshe was mine.%K%P
我理所当然地伸出了手，\n强烈地主张了对她的所有权…%K%P
She took my hand with no hesitation, clinging to me with\nall the strength her tiny body could muster.%K%P
所以都子也理所当然地接纳了我，\n那娇小的身躯紧紧蜷缩在我的臂弯下。%K%P
