Still, Toko wouldn't let go of my arm.\nRather, she clung to it even stronger.%K%P
即使如此，都子也没有离开我的臂弯。\n非但没有离开，反而抱得更紧了。%K%P
I placed my free hand on top of hers as it clutched my\narm, and squeezed it with even more force.%K%P
所以，我也将搂住都子的手\n与她空着的右手重合，比她更加用力地握紧。%K%P
