刚才的都子太过直截了当了。%K%P
I wasn't sure if she was ruminating over the three years\nshe spent in school or everything that happened just now\nduring the graduation, but...%K%P
现在她的脑海里，是三年学园生活的回忆呢，\n还是毕业典礼上的一些事呢，无法猜测…%K%P
