Meanwhile, all I would have been to her was a jobless\nclown of a man hopelessly infatuated with her wonderful\nmother.%K%P
而且，即使我这样的异端分子过来，\n也只会被她当成是恋慕美丽未亡人的可怜失业男人吧。%K%P
